WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.400
Kairi, is dinner ready yet?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.180
Please just wait a little longer.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.360
There was a lot of laundry piled up and it took a while to finish.

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:57.830
Isn't it already 8:30?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:01.760
Eating after 9:00 will make me gain weight. So hurry it up, okay?

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.400
She is completely worthless.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:07.210
So did you live like this before I came here, Sis?

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:09.880
If I left you on your own, you'd only eat convenience store food?

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.330
Sure, why not? And now you make it for me, Kairi.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.950
But I'm not going to be here forever.

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:21.300
Once my mission at Seiyo Elementary is over, I'll return to our parents' house.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:24.780
Then let's make this your last mission, shall we?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:28.710
Tomorrow night, we'll commence that plan.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:33.340
With Utau and Dia's power, we'll crush Seiyo Elementary.

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:36.060
We won't let those Guardians get in our way anymore.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.110
Crush Seiyo Elementary?

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:44.670
In order to do that, I want you to hand out the rest of the teaser CDs to the Seiyo Elementary students.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:48.500
Make sure you do it, Kairi.

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:54.410
Episode 40
Rima! Unlock your Heart!

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.650
Whaddaya mean, maternity leave?!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:07.710
Kairi, do you not think that you are bending too easily to your sister's will?

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:11.620
I can't help it. "Respect and honor your elders."

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.140
That's what Confucius taught.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:18.950
I was surprised half a year ago, when my sister visited home, that she was able to see you, Musashi.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.720
No way, a Guardian Character?

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:25.110
Please! If you're a Character Bearer, help me with my job!

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.720
Please transfer to Seiyo Elementary, and infiltrate the Guardians!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:30.500
The Guardians?

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:35.160
When she begs me that much, I really can't refuse.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.040
She saved my life, after all.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.790
Are you okay, Kairi?

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.500
Wasn't that just the mumps?

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:44.950
Regardless, every favor must be repaid in kind.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.230
Tomorrow, I'll distribute the CDs.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.660
It's my final mission.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.130
It's only two of us today, but we're still DARTS!

00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.050
So, Gaku, do you know about the big new hit manga, "Gag Manga Daioh?"

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.480
You know it, right, Sho?

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.400
Bala-Balance!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.490
New Social Discussion Television

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.490
What to do!? Looking at Japanese Education

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.340
And so it seems the next election is looming large.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.090
I'm tired again today.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.650
For our next topic...

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:17.190
There have recently been an increase in the number of incidents

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.280
of children who sneak out of their homes and wander about town.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:23.210
Terrible. It's because they weren't raised right.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.490
Rima.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.620
What is it, Mom?

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.830
Take this with you tomorrow.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.200
It's a letter of withdrawal.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:39.230
You're going to quit that "Guardian" club after tomorrow.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.760
Huh?! Why, why, why?

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:44.150
But Mom...

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.760
I keep having to pick you up at different times; it's a real problem.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:51.600
You understand that my job keeps me very busy, don't you?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.570
Tomorrow...

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.590
Is that true, Amu-chi?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:04.430
Yeah. Everyone who listened to the teaser CD gathered together, and their hearts' eggs turned into X Eggs.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.680
I managed to cleanse all of them somehow, but...

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:13.400
Oh? So the teaser CD is really that scary?

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:17.980
If Hinamori-san hadn't come when she did, I don't know what would have happened to me either.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:20.330
Yes, she is quite the reliable servant.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.860
Thanks to her, we managed to Character Transform.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.460
"Servant?"

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.540
Character Transformations sure sound nice.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.980
We want to Character Transform, too-dechu.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.800
Thank you, Hinamori-san.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.840
N-No, I didn't really do...

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.300
What's with this atmosphere?

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:42.210
Ah! These school-kids are noticing the opposite sex!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:45.660
We're getting three bars of love reception here!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:52.830
Love, love... Amu and Tadase's love starts in T-minus 5...

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.370
What's with that song?

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:57.420
It's offensive to my artistic sensibility!

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:58.910
Now now...

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:05.310
That was a close one, though. I'd promised to borrow the teaser CD from a friend today.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.370
Where did she get it from?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.880
She said it just appeared in her bag at some point.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:12.090
The same thing happened to me.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.490
But why do it at school?

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:18.690
The way I see it, that means the culprit is somewhere in the school as well.

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:21.620
So that means someone is secretly sticking them in people's bags?

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:22.840
No way.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:26.920
In any case, we can't just leave this alone.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.510
We have to collect all the CDs in the school immediately.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.400
Right.

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:32.920
Possession of Teaser CDs prohibited! If you find one, give it to the Guardians

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.580
If anyone has a teaser CD, please bring it here.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:38.930
Collection box

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.930
Out with them, all of you!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.000
Okay, I'll leave the fourth-graders to you, Rima.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:46.580
You're going to quit that "Guardian" club after tomorrow.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.700
Is something the matter, Rima?

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.410
She said to deal with the fourth-graders.

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.480
Oh, okay.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.890
A letter of withdrawal?

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.270
Amu-chan, that's...

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.500
Does that mean Rima's going to quit the Guardians?

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.350
Did you see DARTS' Bala-Balance yesterday?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.140
It's got to be something her mother is making her do.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:16.070
As Guardians, we go home much later...

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.620
But she cannot just force her to quit!

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:23.240
Hey, will you give this back to Kusukusu without letting Rima know?

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:24.270
Sure.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:27.870
Rima.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.410
What are you going to do with those CDs?

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.380
You aren't going to distribute them?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.710
It's not that. It's just, it'd be dangerous to act right now.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.180
For now, I'll just hide them.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.510
Man, just how many of these <i>are</i> there?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:02.220
There's no end to them!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.000
I'm tired-dechu! I don't wanna do this anymore-dechu!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:07.050
I wonder if there are any others.

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:10.690
Yeah, I'm sure many kids are keeping them hidden.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:17.540
Because of the rule that says you have to give it to someone else in seven days, some are scared to turn it in.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.740
What a scumbag! Sneaking around and handing it to people! That's so low!

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.290
Yeah, yeah!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.680
We've gotta find this person soon and punish them.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:30.010
I will definitely cleanse their twisted personality!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.190
Huh? Is something wrong, Chairman?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.890
No, it's nothing.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.120
Oh?

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.640
Listen, loyal subjects!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.500
I have come up with an excellent idea!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.160
That suspicious black car was playing the teaser CD last night.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.880
Now that it's gotten its first taste, the chances of it coming back for more are high!

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:50.470
And if we find that...

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:53.710
I see! And then, before it can take X Eggs from everyone...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.430
We defeat the black car.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.480
And clean it up all at once!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.090
It's <i>my</i> idea!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.880
Okay, we'll start patrolling early this evening!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.090
Yeah!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.720
But that's my nap time-dechu!

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:09.540
Hey, I said it first! Listen to me!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.180
Patrol? Sounds pretty fun!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.770
This isn't a game, you know.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.730
It's dangerous, so I think it'd be better to-

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.910
It'll be okay. If something happens, we can Character Transform.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.140
And you can Character Transform now, too. Right, Tadase-kun?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.100
But my Character Transformation is a little embarrassing.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:30.510
Yeah? I think it's pretty cool, actually.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.620
Really? If you say it's cool, Hinamori-san, then...

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.170
Tadase-kun.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.690
Three bars full of love reception, once again!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.390
Anyway, we've decided to patrol!

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:41.810
Yes, let's do our best.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.270
Yeah!

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:45.270
When should we meet up?

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.880
Right. How about we meet at the main gate at-

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:51.440
I... I can't go.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:52.740
Rima.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:58.290
It's stupid to use our own time like this, and I refuse to waste any more of mine.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:01.040
Mashiro-san!

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:03.310
Rima.

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.150
Mom, thanks for waiting.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.230
Did you hand in the letter of withdrawal as you should have?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.500
From today on, I'll be picking you up at the same time, okay? It'll be a big help.

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:23.930
Rima.

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.330
Utau, tonight's plan is perfect.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:53.010
I call it the great "annihilate all those bugs that get in the way of searching for the Embryo" plan.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.710
That's a description, not a title.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:11:01.890
Those Guardian kids would never think we'd target the school itself.

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.890
We're starting, Utau.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:17.820
Amu-chan, hurry!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.600
Man, Mom and Dad were really nagging me about going out at night!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:27.530
Beg Beg

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:27.530
Stern Stern

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.120
But you can't go outside this late, Amu-chan!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.490
That's right. What will you do if something happens?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:32.560
But because she said it was something to do with the Guardians, they let her go.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.510
Do you think Rima will come?

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.650
It didn't sound like she will.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.390
But I don't think that's what she was really thinking.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.740
A song! I can hear singing!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.730
Let's go!

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:51.400
Wait!

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.870
That black car!

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:07.660
Hinamori-san!

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:08.850
Tadase-kun!

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.650
It's the same song as before.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.520
Everyone's hearts' eggs!

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:24.470
As I thought, this song steals people's eggs.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:25.870
Hinamori-san.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:26.680
Right.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.440
My heart:

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:31.450
Unlock!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.700
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.170
My heart:

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:51.470
Unlock!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.560
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:13.950
Go, X Eggs.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.650
Stay away from us!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.670
There are so many of them.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.540
Holy Crown!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.550
Amu-chi!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:35.550
Whenever you're in trouble, that's when I'll make my entrance!

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.490
Gigantic Pacifier Attack!

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.660
Wah! It's scary!

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:43.590
Hey!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.550
Mommy, Mommy, look at this!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:02.890
It's a funny face!

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:06.390
Oh, Rima.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:10.730
It's your fault Rima was abducted on her way home from school!

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.160
What the hell were you doing?

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:14.860
Are you actually blaming <i>me?</i>

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.750
You're one to talk, always working at the office and never answering your cell phone!

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:20.080
It's the mother's job to look after the child!

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.540
So it's you that's...

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.480
Daddy, Mommy...

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:27.550
Look, a funny face.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:30.950
Stop being an idiot and goofing off!

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:40.360
Give me a break! I'm tired!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.920
What, and you think I'm not?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.300
That's not what I said!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:45.920
Mom... Everyone...

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.310
What are you saying, then? You're always like this!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.130
There are too many X Eggs!

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:52.960
Help.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:55.460
Just as I planned.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:05.360
This is all my fault.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.160
Amu-chan, call someone for help!

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.390
Rima, your cell phone is ringing.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.640
Are you okay, Hinamori-san?

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:27.220
Rima.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.040
Where are you going?

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:31.130
I'll be right back.

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:33.370
What're you talking about? You can't go out this late.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.060
Stop this at once.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:37.310
What'll we do if you're taken again?

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.080
The letter of withdrawal?

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:43.980
Rima!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.620
Look! This is because you didn't raise her properly!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.810
What are you talking about?

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:50.470
You're always working without stopping to consider your family!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.640
What?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.860
You're both idiots.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:57.650
Always fighting about the same thing, you're both idiots.

00:15:58.030 --> 00:16:00.950
You don't have to always pick me up, I can get home on my own.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.200
Don't keep me locked up inside the house!

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:07.780
Outside of this house, I know...

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.940
There's a world out there for me!

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.370
Rima!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:16.910
My world...

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.650
My heart:

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.110
Unlock!

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.560
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:42.920
I think I'm a goner!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.340
Ouch.

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.720
Juggling Party.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:03.180
Rima, you came!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.920
Sheesh, Rima-tan, did you have to take so long?

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:08.770
Amu, now's your chance!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:09.660
Right.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:17.280
Colorful Canvas Special!

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.440
White Decoration!

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:35.490
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:40.320
Open Heart!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.520
Dia.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.200
Amu.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:13.920
Rima!

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:26.660
Darn.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.580
It's that egg again.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.940
A completely white egg.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.070
The children are all here!

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.380
Yuki!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.270
Mom.

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:43.660
Kurumi-chan!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:44.820
Rima.

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:47.580
I was right, you did come here.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:52.320
I don't understand why you associate with those delinquent Guardians! Stop it at once!

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:55.690
I agree, having all the children come here this late...

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.830
What's wrong with their school?

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.060
It seems like these "Guardians" are the ones at fault.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.500
Wait, please!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.340
This is...

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.250
Get rid of the Guardians!

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.050
That's right!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:06.610
What should we do?

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.970
My goodness, what's going on here?

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.910
The planetarium's caretaker? I mean, Founding Ki-

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:15.920
Chairman!

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.640
Huh? The Ch-Chairman?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.010
So you're the Chairman!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:24.530
What's the meaning of this?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:28.410
Tonight is the peak of the Recorder Constellation Meteor Shower.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:32.270
And that's why everyone is gathered here at school, to observe it.

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:36.320
Looking up at the night sky, they can expand their many senses.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:40.320
Observing the heavens is the best event for one's emotional development.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.910
Did they not tell you?

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:45.370
It's fine for the whole family to attend.

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:48.050
What a bunch of lies.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.630
Now then, shall we proceed to the roof?

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:52.620
Oh, so that's what this is about.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.860
Daisuke, why didn't you tell me?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.710
How pointless.

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:01.350
We're going home, Rima.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.120
Rima!

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:11.890
Kusukusu, Rima, like you always do!

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:16.170
Bala-Balance!

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.860
It's so embarrassing!

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:24.070
It's Bala-Balance!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.460
Yay!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.830
What are you doing all of a sudden?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.270
Stop this foolishness already!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:33.410
It's not foolishness.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.910
We laugh when we're happy.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.950
Mr. and Mrs. Mashiro, when was the last time you laughed?

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:44.050
Take a closer look at Rima's face.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.080
Rima just wants you to laugh again.

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:59.100
Dad, Mom, let's go home.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.770
Right.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.680
Rima, you can do it.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:14.200
Huh? So the singer on the teaser CD was Utau-chan?

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:17.650
Yeah, I'm sure of it. I saw Dia back there.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:21.340
But there's still the person distributing the CDs.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.140
Indeed. There should be a clue around here somewhere.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.440
Time for another patrol-dechu.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:27.580
You bet!

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.640
I can't do this anymore. I'm going to give these CDs back to my sister!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:36.300
This is the first time you've ever disobeyed your sister, is it not?

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:37.790
Are you okay with that?

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:38.910
It's fine!

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:41.250
Ah, Chairman!

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.250
Sanjo-kun!

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.340
Where did you-

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:49.180
Teaser CDs?

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:50.420
Why do you have so many?

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:53.340
He can't be the one distributing the CDs, can he?

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:55.800
No way, those are just the ones we confiscated.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:56.960
Right?

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:03.380
What a surprise. You still believe that?

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:08.140
You people are such good-natured fools.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:11.330
The one who's been distributing the CDs is indeed me.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.240
I'm a spy for Easter.

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:15.740
Your enemy.

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:42.830
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:43.970
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:47.180
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:50.130
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:54.970
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:58.590
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.590 --> 00:23:02.130
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:05.140
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:05.890
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.510
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.300
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:13.220
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.220 --> 00:23:16.660
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:17.600
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:18.640
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.640 --> 00:23:20.880
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.880 --> 00:23:27.510
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:34.670
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:51.840
I'm shocked!

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:55.510
Kairi-kun really said he was Easter's spy, didn't he?

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:57.020
This must be a mistake.

00:23:57.070 --> 00:23:58.060
It just has to be.

00:23:58.100 --> 00:23:59.150
That'd be nice, but...

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:01.040
I believe in the Chairman!

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.540
I'm going to believe in him!

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:05.910
What you believe is scooped out from under you.

00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:05.860
I believe! I believe!

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:09.600
Even Buddha gets upset if his face is hit three times.

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.890
I believe, I believe.

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:10.340
Hey!

00:24:10.390 --> 00:24:11.600
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.640 --> 00:24:12.950
Your True Self!

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:14.910
Believe... I believe!

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:17.400
When I believe, if I believe, believe it!

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:19.830
Amu-chan broke!
